    "body": "Hi @carols10cents, I think you might either need to disable the [`line_break` module](https://starship.rs/config/#line-break) or change the format to the following\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n-format = \"\"\"$all $fill $time\r\n-$character\"\"\"\r\n+format = \"\"\"$all $fill $time $line_break$character\"\"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if this is the same for `zsh` but for `bash` when you enable the fill module it sometimes requires that you start a new shell session before it calculates the width correctly.",
